  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia-South Asia Electricity Transmission and Trade Project (CASA-1000)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to meet the electricity demand in Afghanistan and Pakistan through the establishment of cross-border energy exchange among four member countries as part of regional economic integration. The exchange will be utilizing efficient, and environmentally friendly indigenous hydropower resources of Tajikistan and Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </description>
